+   and social benefits computation rules. Copyright (C) 2020 Inria, contributor:
+   Denis Merigoux <denis.merigoux@inria.fr>, Alain Delaët
+   <alain.delaet--tixeuil@inria.Fr>, Louis Gesbert <louis.gesbert@inria.fr>
